 "task": "A 48-port switch, ten things plugged in, and two jobs. Security wants the device with MAC 00:00:5e:00:53:4c off the network: find its port and shut it. Facilities wants the port the loading-dock camera is on described as `CAM-DOCK-1`. Use pipes so you read three lines, not three screens.",
 "hints": [
  "`show mac-address-table | include 53:4c` prints only the line with that MAC in it, port included.",
  "`show lldp neighbor-info | include CAM` finds the camera by the name it gives on LLDP.",
  "Pipes on 10.18: include, exclude, begin and count, with a regex (quote it if it has spaces). `section` and `-i` are not there."
 ],
